1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,498
Kya Sansad Bhavan ka gol design Morena ke is mandir se aaya?

2
00:00:04,498 --> 00:00:08,246
Ek akeli pahadi par patthar ka ek gol ghera hai.

3
00:00:08,246 --> 00:00:12,369
Bahar se dekho, toh Delhi ki purani Sansad yaad aati hai.

4
00:00:12,369 --> 00:00:15,742
Lekin is daave ka koi kagzi sabut nahi mila.

5
00:00:15,742 --> 00:00:19,490
Toh sach kya hai, chaliye sabut ke saath dekhte hain.

6
00:00:19,490 --> 00:00:23,863
Is mandir ke beech mein chhat nahi hai.

7
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:29,329
Aangan seedha aasmaan ki taraf khula hai. Log kehte hain,

8
00:00:29,329 --> 00:00:32,608
yeh jaan-boojhkar khula chhoda gaya tha.

9
00:00:32,608 --> 00:00:36,981
Kyunki yahan 64 yoginiyan aasmaan se utarti thin.

10
00:00:36,981 --> 00:00:40,807
Yogini yaani Devi ki shaktiyon ke roop,

11
00:00:40,807 --> 00:00:43,540
jinhe udne wala mana gaya.

12
00:00:43,540 --> 00:00:47,183
Lekin pattharon ke paas apni alag kahani hai.

13
00:00:47,183 --> 00:00:51,737
Yahan ek shilalekh mila, yaani patthar par khuda hua lekh.

14
00:00:51,737 --> 00:00:56,747
Usme ek raja ka naam hai, aur ek saal likha hai.

15
00:00:56,747 --> 00:00:59,479
Beech mein Shiva ka mandir hai,

16
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:02,211
aur chhat mein chhed wale patthar.

17
00:01:02,211 --> 00:01:06,310
Yeh chhed baarish ka paani neeche le jaate the.

18
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:09,348
Is video mein hum ek ek sabut kholenge.

19
00:01:09,348 --> 00:01:11,247
Pehle granth kya kehte hain.

20
00:01:11,247 --> 00:01:13,906
Phir khudai aur report kya kehti hai.

21
00:01:13,906 --> 00:01:17,704
Phir experts kahan alag raay rakhte hain. Aur aakhir mein,

22
00:01:17,704 --> 00:01:20,743
aap khud wahan jaakar kya dekh sakte hain.

23
00:01:20,743 --> 00:01:24,541
Har panel par likha hoga, yeh granth hai, sabut hai,

24
00:01:24,541 --> 00:01:25,680
ya sirf kahani.

25
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,981
Shuru karte hain granth se.

26
00:01:27,981 --> 00:01:31,203
Agni Purana ek purana Hindu granth hai,

27
00:01:31,203 --> 00:01:33,964
jisme pooja ke niyam bhi hain.

28
00:01:33,964 --> 00:01:39,027
Iske Tantra wale adhyayon mein 64 yoginiyon ke naam milte hain.

29
00:01:39,027 --> 00:01:42,248
Tantra yaani pooja ki ek gupt parampara,

30
00:01:42,248 --> 00:01:45,930
jisme mantra aur mandala ka bada mahatva hai.

31
00:01:45,930 --> 00:01:53,286
Agni Purana ke hisaab se yeh yoginiyan Shiva ke Bhairava roop ke chaaron taraf hoti hain.

32
00:01:53,286 --> 00:01:57,424
Har ek ka apna naam hai, apna aahvaan hai.

33
00:01:57,424 --> 00:02:01,103
Aahvaan yaani pooja mein unhe bulane ki vidhi.

34
00:02:01,103 --> 00:02:04,781
Yeh ek ghera banata hai, beech mein Shiva,

35
00:02:04,781 --> 00:02:06,620
aur chaaron taraf shaktiyan.

36
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:11,086
Granth mein gol mandala ki vyavastha bhi batayi gayi hai.

37
00:02:11,086 --> 00:02:15,552
Mandala yaani pooja ke liye bana ek pavitra gol naksha.

38
00:02:15,552 --> 00:02:20,018
Ab socho, agar is naksha ko patthar mein banaya jaaye.

39
00:02:20,018 --> 00:02:23,144
Toh kaisa dikhega? Beech mein ek mandir,

40
00:02:23,144 --> 00:02:26,270
aur gol deewar mein chhote chhote kamre.

41
00:02:26,270 --> 00:02:30,388
Ab aati hai lok-katha, jiska koi likhit sabut nahi.

42
00:02:30,388 --> 00:02:35,420
Gaon ke buzurg kehte hain, raat ko yoginiyan udkar aati thin.

43
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:38,623
Isiliye aangan ki chhat nahi banayi gayi.

44
00:02:38,623 --> 00:02:42,282
Yeh kahani pidhi dar pidhi sunayi gayi hai.

45
00:02:42,282 --> 00:02:46,400
Hum ise kahani hi kahenge, aur iska samman karenge.

46
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:49,986
Ek aur kahani bhi chalti hai. Kehte hain,

47
00:02:49,986 --> 00:02:53,123
yeh mandir ek tarah ka vidyalaya tha.

48
00:02:53,123 --> 00:02:58,054
Yahan suraj ki chaal dekhkar ganit aur jyotish padhaya jaata tha.

49
00:02:58,054 --> 00:03:02,088
Jyotish yaani grahon aur taaron ki chaal ka hisaab.

50
00:03:02,088 --> 00:03:06,570
Lekin yeh bhi lok-katha hai, koi shilalekh yeh nahi kehta.

51
00:03:06,570 --> 00:03:11,666
Toh granth humein 64 yoginiyan aur gol mandala dete hain.

52
00:03:11,666 --> 00:03:16,761
Lok-katha humein udti yoginiyan aur suraj ka vidyalaya deti hai.

53
00:03:16,761 --> 00:03:21,347
Lekin patthar kya kehte hain? Kab bana, kisne banaya,

54
00:03:21,347 --> 00:03:24,914
aur kisne pehli baar duniya ko bataya?

55
00:03:24,914 --> 00:03:29,500
Ab chalte hain khoj ki taraf, sabut ke saath.

56
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:32,951
Yeh mandir Madhya Pradesh ke Morena zile mein hai,

57
00:03:32,951 --> 00:03:37,170
Mitaoli gaon ke paas. Kuch log ise Mitawali bhi kehte hain.

58
00:03:37,170 --> 00:03:40,238
Sadiyon tak yeh pahadi par chupchaap khada raha.

59
00:03:40,238 --> 00:03:42,155
Gaon wale ise jaante the,

60
00:03:42,155 --> 00:03:45,990
lekin bahar ki duniya ke nakshon par yeh nahi tha.

61
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:48,813
Phir aate hain M. B. Garde,

62
00:03:48,813 --> 00:03:51,635
Gwalior State Archaeological Department ke officer.

63
00:03:51,635 --> 00:03:54,928
Unhone is mandir ka baakayda survey kiya.

64
00:03:54,928 --> 00:03:59,633
Survey yaani jagah ko naapna, dekhna aur likhit report banana.

65
00:03:59,633 --> 00:04:07,160
Saal 1915 ke aas paas ki unki report mein is mandir ka pehla zikr milta hai.

66
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:11,381
Garde ne sirf mandir nahi dekha, uske shilalekh bhi padhe.

67
00:04:11,381 --> 00:04:15,181
Yahi us zamane ki khoj ka asli kaam tha.

68
00:04:15,181 --> 00:04:19,824
Patthar par khude akshar padhna, unhe likhna, aur sambhaal kar rakhna.

69
00:04:19,824 --> 00:04:24,890
Isi report ki wajah se aage ke historian is mandir tak pahunche.

70
00:04:24,890 --> 00:04:29,316
Phir aazadi ke baad ek bada kadam utha.

71
00:04:29,316 --> 00:04:35,402
Archaeological Survey of India, yaani ASI, desh ki puratatva sanstha hai.

72
00:04:35,402 --> 00:04:39,828
Puratatva yaani purani cheezon aur jagahon ka vigyan.

73
00:04:39,828 --> 00:04:47,020
ASI ne is gol mandir ko rashtriya mahatva ka sanrakshit smarak ghoshit kiya.

74
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:50,669
Yeh ghoshna 1951 mein hui. Iska matlab,

75
00:04:50,669 --> 00:04:55,881
ab yeh mandir kanoon ki hifazat mein hai. Yahan todphod,

76
00:04:55,881 --> 00:04:59,530
kabza ya manmaana nirmaan nahi ho sakta.

77
00:04:59,530 --> 00:05:05,264
Yaani sarkar ne maana ki yeh patthar sirf gaon ke nahi,

78
00:05:05,264 --> 00:05:07,870
poore desh ki virasat hain.

79
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:12,848
Ab report bhi hai, aur kanoon ki hifazat bhi.

80
00:05:12,848 --> 00:05:18,932
Lekin asli sawaal abhi baaki hai. Mandir ke andar kya hai?

81
00:05:18,932 --> 00:05:22,803
Kitne kamre hain, beech mein kya hai,

82
00:05:22,803 --> 00:05:26,122
aur woh shilalekh kya kehta hai?

83
00:05:26,122 --> 00:05:29,440
Chaliye pahadi chadhkar andar chalte hain.

84
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:33,066
Upar pahunchte hi ek badi gol deewar dikhti hai.

85
00:05:33,066 --> 00:05:37,498
Is deewar ke andar ki taraf chhote chhote kamre bane hain.

86
00:05:37,498 --> 00:05:40,721
In kamron ko cell ya kaksh kehte hain.

87
00:05:40,721 --> 00:05:44,750
Har kamre ke saamne khambon wala ek chhota hissa hai.

88
00:05:44,750 --> 00:05:47,570
Poora ghera ek pahiye jaisa lagta hai.

89
00:05:47,570 --> 00:05:52,794
Ab ginti suniye. Is gol deewar mein 65 kamre hain.

90
00:05:52,794 --> 00:05:58,541
Vidwaanon ka anumaan hai, har yogini ke liye ek kamra tha.

91
00:05:58,541 --> 00:06:02,198
Aur ek kamra khud Devi ke liye.

92
00:06:02,198 --> 00:06:06,900
Aaj zyaadatar kamre khaali hain, murtiyan wahan nahi dikhti.

93
00:06:06,900 --> 00:06:11,136
Beech ke khule aangan mein ek gol mandir hai,

94
00:06:11,136 --> 00:06:13,490
jo Shiva ko samarpit hai.

95
00:06:13,490 --> 00:06:17,726
Yaani granth wala naksha yahan patthar mein dikhta hai.

96
00:06:17,726 --> 00:06:21,963
Beech mein Shiva, aur chaaron taraf shaktiyon ke kamre.

97
00:06:21,963 --> 00:06:26,670
Aangan ke upar koi chhat nahi hai, sirf khula aasmaan.

98
00:06:26,670 --> 00:06:31,260
Vidwaan aise khule mandir ko hypaethral mandir kehte hain.

99
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:34,320
Hypaethral yaani jiski chhat na ho,

100
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:37,380
jo seedha aasmaan ke neeche ho.

101
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:41,460
Yogini mandiron mein yeh khaasiyat aksar dikhti hai.

102
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:45,030
Lok-katha iski wajah udti yoginiyan batati hai,

103
00:06:45,030 --> 00:06:48,600
lekin patthar khud koi wajah nahi batata.

104
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,692
Ab sabse dilchasp cheez dekhiye.

105
00:06:50,692 --> 00:06:54,875
Beech ke mandir ki chhat par patthar ki patiyan hain.

106
00:06:54,875 --> 00:06:57,803
In patiyon mein chhote chhote chhed hain.

107
00:06:57,803 --> 00:07:01,568
Baarish ka paani in chhedon se neeche jaata tha.

108
00:07:01,568 --> 00:07:06,170
Aur zameen ke neeche ek badi tanki mein jama hota tha.

109
00:07:06,170 --> 00:07:10,097
Isko aaj ki bhasha mein rainwater harvesting kehte hain.

110
00:07:10,097 --> 00:07:15,770
Yaani baarish ke paani ko bekaar bahne dene ki jagah sambhaal kar rakhna.

111
00:07:15,770 --> 00:07:20,133
Ek sookhi pahadi par yeh bahut kaam ki cheez thi.

112
00:07:20,133 --> 00:07:24,060
Pooja ka mandir bhi, aur paani ka intezaam bhi.

113
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:25,487
Ab woh shilalekh.

114
00:07:25,487 --> 00:07:31,194
Ek patthar ki patti par khude lekh mein saal 1323 likha hai.

115
00:07:31,194 --> 00:07:35,474
Yeh saal Isvi yaani CE ke hisaab se hai.

116
00:07:35,474 --> 00:07:40,230
Lekh mein Kachchhapaghata vansh ke raja Devapala ka naam hai.

117
00:07:40,230 --> 00:07:44,510
Yaani raja ki sarparasti mein mandir ka kaam hua.

118
00:07:44,510 --> 00:07:48,498
Kachchhapaghata vansh kaun tha? Yeh ek madhyakaleen raajvansh tha,

119
00:07:48,498 --> 00:07:51,600
jo is ilaake mein raaj karta tha.

120
00:07:51,600 --> 00:07:55,587
Madhyakaleen yaani prachin aur aadhunik ke beech ka daur.

121
00:07:55,587 --> 00:08:00,461
Isi vansh ke raja ka naam is mandir ke patthar par

122
00:08:00,461 --> 00:08:03,120
aaj bhi pada ja sakta hai.

123
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:07,531
Toh ab humare paas naam bhi hai, aur saal bhi.

124
00:08:07,531 --> 00:08:09,295
Lagta hai kahani khatam.

125
00:08:09,295 --> 00:08:12,823
Lekin yahin se asli bahas shuru hoti hai.

126
00:08:12,823 --> 00:08:16,793
Kya yeh shilalekh mandir ke banne ki tareekh hai?

127
00:08:16,793 --> 00:08:19,880
Ya kisi purane mandir ki marammat ki?

128
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:23,850
Aur Sansad Bhavan wala sawaal toh abhi baaki hai.

129
00:08:23,850 --> 00:08:27,900
Sabse pehle tareekh ka vivaad. Kuch historian kehte hain,

130
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:31,950
1323 wala lekh hi mandir banne ki tareekh hai.

131
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:36,000
Baaki kehte hain, mandir isse kaafi pehle bana tha.

132
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:40,050
Aur Kachchhapaghata raajaon ne baad mein iski marammat karwayi.

133
00:08:40,050 --> 00:08:44,100
Dono taraf vidwaan hain, dono ke apne tark hain.

134
00:08:44,100 --> 00:08:46,672
Jhagde ki jad ek hi hai.

135
00:08:46,672 --> 00:08:49,673
Yahan koi neenv ka shilalekh nahi mila.

136
00:08:49,673 --> 00:08:55,245
Neenv ka shilalekh yaani woh lekh jo nirmaan ke waqt lagaya jaata hai.

137
00:08:55,245 --> 00:08:57,817
Woh hota, toh baat saaf hoti.

138
00:08:57,817 --> 00:09:01,247
Puratattva ki ek report bhi yahi kehti hai,

139
00:09:01,247 --> 00:09:03,390
isliye tareekh par matbhed hai.

140
00:09:03,390 --> 00:09:06,165
Ab agla, aur sabse mashhoor vivaad.

141
00:09:06,165 --> 00:09:09,866
Delhi ki purani Sansad Bhavan bhi gol hai.

142
00:09:09,866 --> 00:09:14,954
Bahar chaaron taraf khambon ki lambi qatar hai. Upar se dekho,

143
00:09:14,954 --> 00:09:19,117
toh dono ka aakaar kaafi milta julta lagta hai.

144
00:09:19,117 --> 00:09:23,280
Isiliye log kehte hain, design yahin se liya gaya.

145
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:25,135
Ek paksh kehta hai,

146
00:09:25,135 --> 00:09:29,308
British architects ne Bharat ke mandiron ko dekha tha.

147
00:09:29,308 --> 00:09:34,409
Ho sakta hai, unhone is gol mandir se prerna li ho.

148
00:09:34,409 --> 00:09:38,118
Yeh baat social media par bahut chalti hai.

149
00:09:38,118 --> 00:09:41,828
Lekin is daave ke peeche koi likhit dastavez,

150
00:09:41,828 --> 00:09:44,610
koi chitthi ya naksha nahi mila.

151
00:09:44,610 --> 00:09:48,494
Doosra paksh kehta hai, yeh sirf sanyog ho sakta hai.

152
00:09:48,494 --> 00:09:53,932
Us zamane mein Europe ki neoclassical shaili mein gol imaaratein aur khambe aam the.

153
00:09:53,932 --> 00:09:58,204
Neoclassical yaani purane Greece aur Rome se prerit imaarat ki shaili.

154
00:09:58,204 --> 00:10:01,700
Toh gol aakaar wahan se bhi aa sakta tha.

155
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:06,775
Toh hum kya kahenge? Hum kahenge, yeh daava vivaadit hai.

156
00:10:06,775 --> 00:10:11,850
Milta julta aakaar ek sach hai, aankhon se dikhta hai.

157
00:10:11,850 --> 00:10:15,910
Lekin nakal ka sabut abhi tak nahi mila.

158
00:10:15,910 --> 00:10:20,985
Jab tak dastavez na mile, ise saabit kehna sahi nahi.

159
00:10:20,985 --> 00:10:24,030
Aur jhootha kehna bhi jaldbaazi hogi.

160
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:29,346
Ab baat un sawaalon ki, jinka jawab kisi ke paas nahi.

161
00:10:29,346 --> 00:10:34,661
Har purani jagah ki tarah, yahan bhi kuch khaali jagahein hain.

162
00:10:34,661 --> 00:10:36,594
Khaali kamre, adhoori tareekh,

163
00:10:36,594 --> 00:10:40,460
aur ek gol deewar jo chupchaap khadi hai.

164
00:10:40,460 --> 00:10:43,360
Chaliye ek ek karke dekhte hain.

165
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:46,224
Sabse pehla sawaal, murtiyan kahan gayin?

166
00:10:46,224 --> 00:10:50,997
Bahar ke kamron mein kabhi yoginiyon ki murtiyan rahi hongi.

167
00:10:50,997 --> 00:10:56,248
Aaj woh wahan nahi hain. Unhe kab hataya gaya, kisne hataya,

168
00:10:56,248 --> 00:10:58,634
yeh abhi tak pata nahi.

169
00:10:58,634 --> 00:11:02,930
Koi record is sawaal ka seedha jawab nahi deta.

170
00:11:02,930 --> 00:11:08,048
Agla sawaal, asli nirmaan kab hua? Shilalekh ek saal batata hai,

171
00:11:08,048 --> 00:11:13,165
lekin woh nirmaan ka hai ya marammat ka, yeh saaf nahi.

172
00:11:13,165 --> 00:11:17,353
Agar mandir pehle bana tha, toh pehle kisne banaya?

173
00:11:17,353 --> 00:11:21,540
Yeh sawaal aaj bhi historians ke beech khula hai.

174
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,764
Aur yeh sawaal bhi hai,

175
00:11:23,764 --> 00:11:26,877
ki yeh mandir itna gol kyun hai?

176
00:11:26,877 --> 00:11:29,991
Kya yeh sirf mandala ka naksha tha?

177
00:11:29,991 --> 00:11:33,549
Ya suraj ki chaal dekhne ka koi tareeka?

178
00:11:33,549 --> 00:11:36,217
Granth mandala ki baat karta hai.

179
00:11:36,217 --> 00:11:41,110
Lok-katha suraj ki baat karti hai. Patthar abhi tak chup hain.

180
00:11:41,110 --> 00:11:45,576
Aur aakhri sawaal, yahan sach mein kya hota tha?

181
00:11:45,576 --> 00:11:50,042
Lok-katha kehti hai, raat ko tantric anushthan hote the.

182
00:11:50,042 --> 00:11:52,523
Ek aur katha kehti hai,

183
00:11:52,523 --> 00:11:55,997
ganit aur jyotish ki padhai hoti thi.

184
00:11:55,997 --> 00:11:59,470
Dono ka koi likhit sabut nahi hai.

185
00:11:59,470 --> 00:12:03,440
Shayad sach in dono ke beech kahin hai.

186
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:07,122
Ab sabse achhi baat. Yeh mandir aaj bhi khada hai,

187
00:12:07,122 --> 00:12:09,332
aur aap wahan ja sakte hain.

188
00:12:09,332 --> 00:12:14,118
Yeh Morena zile mein Mitaoli gaon ke paas ek akeli pahadi par hai.

189
00:12:14,118 --> 00:12:16,328
Pahadi lagbhag 30 metre oonchi hai.

190
00:12:16,328 --> 00:12:20,010
Door se hi gol deewar ka ghera dikhne lagta hai.

191
00:12:20,010 --> 00:12:24,084
Mandir tak pahunchne ke liye 100 seedhiyan chadhni padti hain.

192
00:12:24,084 --> 00:12:28,159
Thodi thakaan hogi, lekin upar ka nazaara sab bhula dega.

193
00:12:28,159 --> 00:12:32,641
Chaaron taraf khule khet, aur beech mein patthar ka gol ghera.

194
00:12:32,641 --> 00:12:35,900
Subah ya shaam jaaiye, jab dhoop naram ho.

195
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:41,402
Upar jaakar yeh cheezein zaroor dekhiye. Gol deewar ke khaali kamre,

196
00:12:41,402 --> 00:12:45,905
aur unke saamne ke khambe. Beech ka Shiva mandir,

197
00:12:45,905 --> 00:12:49,906
aur uski chhed wali chhat. Aur khula aangan,

198
00:12:49,906 --> 00:12:52,908
jahan se seedha aasmaan dikhta hai.

199
00:12:52,908 --> 00:12:57,910
Yahan khade hokar aap lok-katha ko mehsoos kar sakte hain.

200
00:12:57,910 --> 00:13:02,734
Ek baat yaad rakhiye. Yeh ASI ka sanrakshit smarak hai.

201
00:13:02,734 --> 00:13:08,040
Deewaron par kuch likhna, patthar todna ya kachra failana mana hai.

202
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:12,863
Yeh virasat humari hai, aur aage ki pidhiyon ki bhi.

203
00:13:12,863 --> 00:13:16,240
Jaise mila, waise hi chhod kar aaiye.

204
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:19,812
Toh ab sab sabut aapke saamne hain.

205
00:13:19,812 --> 00:13:23,894
Granth 64 yoginiyon ka gol mandala deta hai.

206
00:13:23,894 --> 00:13:28,996
Patthar 1323 ka shilalekh aur ek gol mandir dete hain.

207
00:13:28,996 --> 00:13:35,119
Lekin Sansad Bhavan wale daave ka kagzi sabut abhi tak nahi mila.

208
00:13:35,119 --> 00:13:36,650
Faisla aapka hai.

209
00:13:36,650 --> 00:13:39,556
Ab aapse ek aasaan sawaal.

210
00:13:39,556 --> 00:13:45,367
Sansad Bhavan ka gol aakaar is mandir se prerit tha,

211
00:13:45,367 --> 00:13:51,179
ya sirf sanyog? Comment mein bas likhiye, prerna ya sanyog.

212
00:13:51,179 --> 00:13:56,990
Agli baar hum chalenge ek aur rahasyamayi jagah ki taraf,

213
00:13:56,990 --> 00:13:58,733
sabut ke saath.
